<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Henriette of Montbéliard</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 1387–<a href="/years/1444">1444</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Henriette d'Orbe</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Henriette of Montbéliard was the heiress of the County of Montbéliard, betrothed in 1397 to Eberhard IV of Württemberg, whom she married in 1407. Through her the county passed to the house of Württemberg, which held it until the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-revolution">French Revolution</a>. After her husband's death she acted as regent for their sons in Württemberg.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/henriette-of-montbeliard.jpg" alt="Henriette of Montbéliard" width="320" height="515" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:29W%C3%BCrttemberg_und_M%C3%B6mpelgard_Henriette_von_M%C3%B6mpelgard.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
